<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#151515">
  <title>RHEL Image Mode on AWS</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --red: #ee0000;
      --red-dark: #a30000;
      --ink: #151515;
      --muted: #6a6e73;
      --line: #d2d2d2;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --canvas: #f5f5f5;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(238, 0, 0, .12), transparent 28rem),
        var(--canvas);
      font-family: RedHatText, "Red Hat Text", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .topbar {
      height: 6px;
      background: var(--red);
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 26px 32px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .01em;
    }

    .mark {
      position: relative;
      width: 42px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 55% 55% 38% 38%;
      background: var(--red);
      transform: skew(-8deg);
    }

    .mark::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: -5px;
      right: -5px;
      bottom: 2px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--ink);
    }

    .secure {
      color: #3e8635;
      font-size: .9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    main {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 106px);
      padding: 40px 24px 80px;
    }

    .card {
      width: min(920px, 100%);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(21, 21, 21, .12);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: clamp(38px, 7vw, 72px);
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(125deg, #151515 0%, #252525 64%, #4f0000 100%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #f5c2c2;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 24px;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--red);
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-family: RedHatDisplay, "Red Hat Display", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 7vw, 4.8rem);
      line-height: .98;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #d2d2d2;
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    }

    .details {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--red);
    }

    .detail {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 28px 30px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .detail:last-child { border-right: 0; }

    .label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .value {
      display: block;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .image-ref {
      padding: 22px 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fafafa;
    }

    code {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      color: var(--red-dark);
      font-family: "Red Hat Mono", Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: .85rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      header { padding: 22px 20px; }
      .secure { display: none; }
      .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .detail { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .detail:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar"></div>
  <header>
    <div class="brand"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"></span> Red Hat Enterprise Linux</div>
    <div class="secure">● HTTPS enabled</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <article class="card">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="eyebrow">Image mode for RHEL</div>
        <h1>Built once.<br>Run consistently.</h1>
        <p class="lede">This NGINX server runs from a bootc container image, converted into an AWS AMI and deployed through Red Hat Satellite.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="details" aria-label="Deployment details">
        <div class="detail">
          <span class="label">Operating system</span>
          <span class="value">RHEL 9.8</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail">
          <span class="label">Bootc image</span>
          <span class="value">@@IMAGE_NAME@@ @@IMAGE_VERSION@@</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail">
          <span class="label">Platform</span>
          <span class="value">Amazon Web Services</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="image-ref">
        <span class="label">Container image</span>
        <code>@@CONTAINER_IMAGE@@</code>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
